{"strongs": "H6806", "word": "צַ֫עַד", "translit": "tsa.ad", "root": "צנר", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "step, pace", "definition": "[ צַ֫עַד ] noun masculine 2Sam 6:13 step, pace ; — absolute צָ֑עַד Prov 30:29 suffix צַעֲדוֺ Jer 10:3 ; Prov 6:9 , etc.; plural construct צַעֲדֵי Job 18:7 suffix צְעָדַי Job 31:4 , etc.; — 1. literally step, pace , 2Sam 6:13 , תַּרְחִיב צַעֲדִי תַּחְתֵּנִי 2Sam 22:37 = Ps 18:37 , i.e. givest me firm footing, ׳ מֵטִיבֵי צ Prov 30:29 = making a good step , stately in march; Lam 4:18 (|| לָ֑כֶת ). 2. step, steps , in figure of course of life, fortune: singular ׳ לֹא יֵצַר צ Prov 4:12 || דֶּרֶךְ Jer 10:23 ; Prov 16:9 ; Job 14:16 ; Job 31:4 ; Job 34:21 , צַעֲדֵי אוֺנוֺ Job 18:7 (compare Prov 4:12 above); מִסְפַּרעָֿדַי אַגִּידֶנּוּ Prov 31:37 of harlot Prov 5:5 figurative, שְׁאוֺל צְעָדֶיהָ יִתְמֹ֑כוּ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7150')\">BDB7150</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6806')\">H6806</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7149')\">BDB7149</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7151')\">BDB7151</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>צַ֫עַד</bdbheb>] <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"2Sam 6:13\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(10,6,13)\">2Sam 6:13</ref></sup> <highlightword>step, pace</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>צָ֑עַד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 30:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,29)\">Prov 30:29</ref> suffix<bdbheb>צַעֲדוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 10:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,3)\">Jer 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 6:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,9)\">Prov 6:9</ref>, etc.; plural construct <bdbheb>צַעֲדֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 18:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,18,7)\">Job 18:7</ref> suffix <bdbheb>צְעָ